CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/b com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/AttackMovement
	COMMENT How a unit flies/moves while attacking: normal, strafing, moveaway, bomber (used by air units). [constants verified]
	FIELD a normal Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/b;
	FIELD b strafing Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/b;
	FIELD c moveaway Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/b;
	FIELD d bomber Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/b;
